OL,3,ABritish rapper Yung Filly to face
OL,4,Aretrial on rape charges in Australia
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish rapper Yung Filly will face a
OL,7,Fretrial on three rape charges in
OL,8,FAustralia, after a jury cleared him of
OL,9,Fseveral sexual assault offences but
OL,10,Fcould not reach a decision on others.
OL,12,FThe YouTuber, whose real name is Andres
OL,13,FFelipe Valencia Barrientos, was charged
OL,14,Fwith repeatedly raping and assaulting a
OL,15,Ffan after performing at a nightclub in
OL,16,FPerth in 2024.
OL,18,FHe denied all 10 charges, and last
OL,19,Fmonth a jury found him not guilty on
OL,20,Fthree counts of rape.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
